{% comment %}
  Appx — Product Specs Table
  Storefront app block. Renders the spec table assigned to the current product.

  Slice 1, Step 5: semantic (unstyled) <table> output.
  - Reads the assigned template via the app-owned metafield -> metaobject:
    `product.metafields["$app"].spec_table.value` (reserved-prefix BRACKET form;
    dot form does not resolve the reserved namespace). `.status`/`.rows` fields
    are read as `.status.value` / `.rows.value` (json -> iterable array).
  - SECTION_HEADER rows span both columns; DATA rows are label/value pairs.
  - `LINE_BREAK` value parts render as <br>.
  - Author-entered text is escaped (merchants author these — never inject raw HTML).
  - Silent by design: a non-ACTIVE status, no assigned template, or no rows renders
    NOTHING on the storefront (no diagnostic text, no empty box).

  Deferred to the value-resolution slice (not this one):
  - `SHOPIFY_FIELD` / `METAFIELD` parts render as placeholders here; resolving them
    against the live product is later.
  - `hideWhenEmpty`: per data-model.md §9 a row is empty only when it has dynamic
    parts and ALL of them resolve empty. Those parts are unresolved in this slice,
    so no row is empty yet — the rule activates with value resolution.

  CSS lives in assets/spec-table.css and is loaded via the schema "stylesheet"
  attribute — theme app extension blocks cannot use the {% stylesheet %} tag.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign ref = product.metafields["$app"].spec_table
  assign spec = ref.value
  assign rows = spec.rows.value
-%}

{%- if spec != blank and spec.status.value == "ACTIVE" and rows != blank and rows.size > 0 -%}
  <div class="appx-spec-table" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <table class="appx-spec-table__table">
      <tbody>
        {%- for row in rows -%}
          {%- if row.rowType == "SECTION_HEADER" -%}
            <tr class="appx-spec-table__section-row">
              <th class="appx-spec-table__section" colspan="2" scope="colgroup">{{ row.label | escape }}</th>
            </tr>
          {%- else -%}
            <tr class="appx-spec-table__row">
              <th class="appx-spec-table__label" scope="row">{{ row.label | escape }}</th>
              <td class="appx-spec-table__value">
                {%- for part in row.valueParts -%}
                  {%- case part.type -%}
                    {%- when "TEXT" -%}{{ part.text | escape }}
                    {%- when "LINE_BREAK" -%}<br>
                    {%- when "METAFIELD" -%}<span class="appx-spec-table__pending">[metafield:{{ part.namespace | escape }}.{{ part.key | escape }}]</span>
                    {%- when "SHOPIFY_FIELD" -%}<span class="appx-spec-table__pending">[field:{{ part.field | escape }}]</span>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </td>
            </tr>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product specs table",
  "target": "section",
  "stylesheet": "spec-table.css",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  },
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
